    "finish_after": "The owned child advertises its installed lock-free SIGUSR1 handler. Finish interrupts only a stale draft with newer queued PCM; CPU graph operations poll the stop flag. Ack keeps the original sequence; all queued PCM precedes Finish.",
    "canonical_prefix": "Only fully decoded immutable canonical chunks are retained. Interrupted chunks never advance consumed; previous draft cache is cleared. Final decodes every remaining sample with fresh native state and original parameters.",
