    "signal_target": "Only the exclusively owned unreaped Child PID, never a process-name or group search.",
    "legacy_and_whistle": "Ready capability defaults false; older and AOT workers never receive SIGUSR1.",
    "paired_runtime_required": "New worker Ready advertises a field older deny_unknown_fields shells cannot parse. Deliver matching new shared-wire shell and worker; do not pair this worker with the prepared old 5f shell.",
    "model_and_parameters": "Same admitted review object, full native encoder context, greedy/fallback, vocabulary, fresh state and automatic language policy. No cropping, early language confirmation, new model or target-dir sharing.",
    "capture_and_insertion": "Capture stops before signaling; all original final PCM retained. Finishing drops stale preview events; final insertion/focus/undo behavior remains the system primitive. No new permission or action surface."
